; Font Awesome Pro Kit (install-time only). Maps the @awesome.me / @fortawesome
; scopes to the FA registry and reads the auth token from the
; FONTAWESOME_PACKAGE_TOKEN environment variable — no secret lives in this file,
; so it's safe to commit/share.
;   Local dev: set FONTAWESOME_PACKAGE_TOKEN in your shell or user env.
;   Docker:    injected into the `deps` stage's `npm ci` as a BuildKit secret.
@awesome.me:registry=https://npm.fontawesome.com/
@fortawesome:registry=https://npm.fontawesome.com/
//npm.fontawesome.com/:_authToken=${FONTAWESOME_PACKAGE_TOKEN}
